    """@en;
                  rdfs:label "Whisky Terms"@en.
bevon:WhiteWine dcterms:issued "2014-03-07+09:00"^^xsd:date;
                dcterms:modified "2014-03-07+09:00"^^xsd:date;
                a owl:Class;
                rdfs:comment """
    It is produced by the alcoholic fermentation of the non-coloured pulp of
    grapes which may have a white or black skin. It is treated so as to
    maintain a yellow transparent colour in the final product.
    """@en;
                rdfs:isDefinedBy bevon:;
                rdfs:seeAlso wiki:White_wine;
                rdfs:subClassOf bevon:Wine,
                                pto:White_wine;
                owl:sameAs vin:WhiteWine;
                status:term_status "testing"@en;
                skos:definition """
    White wine is a wine whose colour can be straw-yellow, yellow-green, or
    yellow-gold coloured.
    """@en;
                skos:prefLabel "화이트 와인"@ko,
                               "White Wine"@en,
                               "Vin Blanc"@fr.
bevon:Wine dcterms:issued "2013-07-04+09:00"^^xsd:date;
           dcterms:modified "2014-03-07+09:00"^^xsd:date;
           a owl:Class;
           rdfs:isDefinedBy bevon:;
           rdfs:seeAlso wiki:Wine;
           rdfs:subClassOf bevon:FermentedBeverage,
                           pto:Wine;
           status:term_status "testing"@en;
           skos:definition """
    Wine is an alcoholic beverage made from fermented grapes or other fruits.
    """@en;
           skos:historyNote [dcterms:creator <http://jayg.me/> ; 
                             dcterms:date "2014-03-07+09:00"^^xsd:date ; 
                             rdf:value """
      Changed the semantics of bevon:Wine not to be the same as wine:Wine
      """@en];
           skos:prefLabel "Wine"@en,
                          "Vin"@fr,
                          "와인"@ko.
bevon:WineGroup rdf:_1 bevon:Wine;
                rdf:_2 bevon:RedWine;
                rdf:_3 bevon:WhiteWine;
                rdf:_4 bevon:FruitWine;
                a rdf:Bag;
                rdfs:comment """
    These classes describe types of wines.
    """@en;
                rdfs:label "Wine Terms"@en.
