<http://rdfs.co/bevon/beverage/Kilkenny> bevon:abv 4.3;
                                         bevon:container <http://rdfs.co/bevon/container/440mlBeverageCan>,
                                                         <http://rdfs.co/bevon/container/30lBeerKeg>;
                                         bevon:description """
    Kilkenny is a nitrogenated Irish cream ale from the makers of Guinness,
    which originated in Kilkenny, Ireland. The brand is managed and produced
    by Diageo. It is available in draught and cans. It is brewed in Ireland
    and its heritage dates back to the 14th century.
    """@en;
