<http://rdfs.co/bevon/beverage/KozelDark> bevon:abv 3.8;
                                          bevon:container <http://rdfs.co/bevon/container/500mlLongneck>;
                                          bevon:description """
    Velkopopovický Kozel Dark beer is brewed to the original recipe using a
    special mix of dark malts, clean water from our own well close to the
    brewery, and a selection of the best hops. The caramelized malt gives this
    beer a unique ruby color and sweet flavor, thanks to which it is
    appreciated and respected all over the world.
    """@en;
